    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-0x5603b3597600">
    <command xml:space="preserve">look</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">In-Between
You are.. somewhere. Swirling mists curl out of the blackness that appears to exist in between your world and some other place, just out of reach. You hear a faint sound, but you&apos;ll have to actively listen to make sense of it.

You can see a flock of birds here.

&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <played>NO</played>
    <changed>YES</changed>
    <temporary score="0">YES</temporary>
    <annotation xml:space="preserve"></annotation>
  </item>
